* `(-1, -6, 3, -4)` is irreducible: `F(u, v) = −N((u + 2v) − vz)` in `ℤ[z]`, `z³ = (15) z + (-26)`. Its only solution `(−1, 0)` comes from `RankOneSources.K44.source0` (unit generation and the Skolem zero set).
